# Copy to /etc/moreopenrepeater/env (root:moreopenrepeater, mode 640 -- it
# holds the AMI secret) and reference it from the systemd unit's
# EnvironmentFile= directive. See docs/raspberry-pi.md.

# --- HTTP server -------------------------------------------------------
# Sign-in is optional -- set BOTH of the next two lines to enable the
# dashboard's login page (scripts can use HTTP Basic with the same
# credentials), or leave both unset/commented to run with no auth at all (setting
# only one is treated as a misconfiguration and refuses to start, rather
# than silently leaving the API open). Even with auth enabled, binding to
# loopback-only + reaching it over SSH/VPN/Tailscale remains the
# recommended default -- see docs/raspberry-pi.md's security note.
MOREOPENREPEATER_HOST=127.0.0.1
MOREOPENREPEATER_PORT=8000
#MOREOPENREPEATER_AUTH_USER=admin
#MOREOPENREPEATER_AUTH_PASSWORD=changeme

# --- Storage locations ---------------------------------------------------
# Defaults to <repo>/data if unset, which only makes sense for an editable
# install run straight from a repo checkout (which is what this packaging
# assumes -- see docs/raspberry-pi.md). Override if you install elsewhere.
#MOREOPENREPEATER_DATA_DIR=/var/lib/moreopenrepeater
#MOREOPENREPEATER_LOG_PATH=/var/log/moreopenrepeater/moreopenrepeater.log

# --- CM108 USB radio interface (optional) ---------------------------------
# The interface's /dev/hidrawN node (see docs/raspberry-pi.md). Enables
# hardware PTT and the "CM108 COS pin" carrier-detect source; the audio
# devices themselves are chosen on the dashboard's Audio & tones page.
#MOREOPENREPEATER_CM108_HIDRAW=/dev/hidraw0

# --- AllStarLink app_rpt AMI link (optional) ------------------------------
# Unset MOREOPENREPEATER_AMI_HOST entirely to run with link.node_link
# disabled (simulate_remote_keyed-only, as in development).
#MOREOPENREPEATER_AMI_HOST=127.0.0.1
#MOREOPENREPEATER_AMI_PORT=5038
#MOREOPENREPEATER_AMI_USER=admin
#MOREOPENREPEATER_AMI_SECRET=changeme
#MOREOPENREPEATER_AMI_NODE=1999
